# Product rules

You are working on **Reactive Portfolio Builder**, a free MVP portfolio builder.

## Non-negotiables

- Free only — no billing UI or Stripe until product asks
- Email/password auth only (when implementing auth)
- Soft-delete users (`deletedAt`); soft-deleted users cannot log in
- One portfolio per user (unique `userId`); reject a second create
- Prebuilt section types only: Hero, About, Skills, Projects, Experience, Education, Contact
- Each section type at most once; allow reorder + visibility toggle
- Public portfolios are one page at `/{slug}`
- Palette presets only; each preset has exactly: primary, secondary, accent, textDark, textLight
- Slug: lowercase hyphenated, unique, reserved app routes blocked (`login`, `signup`, `dashboard`, `editor`, `api`, …)

